{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-05-24 09:00:00', 'title': 'DENSO, HONEYWELL ASCEND INTO URBAN AIR MOBILITY WITH EXPANDED ALLIANCE', 'text': 'SOUTHFIELD, MICH.,\xa0AND PHOENIX, MAY 24, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DENSO, A LEADING MOBILITY SUPPLIER, HAS SIGNED A LONG-TERM AGREEMENT WITH AEROSPACE LEADER HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON), ESTABLISHING AN ALLIANCE FOCUSED ON ELECTRIC PROPULSION UNITS TO MEET NEW AEROSPACE NEEDS.'}